msgid "The installation medium is damaged: part of it cannot be read as it was made. Nothing on the disks has changed. Copy the image to the USB drive again, check its SHA-256, or use another USB drive."
msgstr "Media pemasangan rosak: sebahagian kandungannya tidak dapat dibaca seperti semasa dibuat. Tiada apa-apa berubah pada cakera. Salin semula imej ke pemacu USB, semak SHA-256nya, atau gunakan pemacu USB lain."

